Read the frozen stylized-3d profile and approved reference sheet. Recipes and
declared dependencies generate GLB, blend source and previews. Keep art/builds
and provenance with the asset. Byte hashes, geometry budgets and required clips
are machine checks; silhouette, materials, collision fit and feel need real
Godot visual review. Blender preview quality is not runtime quality.
